    "detailed_description": "Edelweiss Knights puts the player at the helm of a trio of powerful Saints: Edel, Aliza and Violet. Explore an unspoiled mountain-top domain in search of a mystical source of power, peering into the Saints' inner motivations as the struggle puts their faith to the test. Fight powerful Deities of unbeknownst nature and their mysterious underlings, in a quest to ascend to the Higher Planes of existence.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Win Battles Through Teamwork</h2>Fight the mysterious Godlings and their Leaders, moving each of the Saints across a dynamic grid-based battlefield. Use your wits to position your Units carefully and outsmart the enemy by leveraging on each of your party member's specialities.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Conquer the Battlefield</h2>Lead the Saints across a node-based Map, in a quick succession of tactical skirmishes, each offering random enemy encounters and configurations. Use different tiles' properties and place traps and hazards wisely to solve confrontations efficiently.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Capture Powerful Deities</h2>Align with or against powerful Deities based on your actions and their caprices. Satisfy special requirements to unlock a fateful battle with a Deity, elusive, powerful creatures granting benefits to whoever succeeds in subjugating them.",
